olumn 5: Frame 2147230206 -->\n      <div class=\"hz-col\">\n        <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810729.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810729\" class=\"hz-img\" style=\"height:291px;background-color:#c8c8c8;\" />\n\n        <!-- Frame 2147230307: Research document card -->\n        <div style=\"width:100%;height:393px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background-color:#b7bdc9;flex-shrink:0;\">\n          <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810727.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;background-color:#b7bdc9;\" />\n          <!-- Research document overlay -->\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;top:18px;left:18px;right:18px;bottom:18px;background-color:#dadae7;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2.8px 2.2px rgba(0,0,0,0.02),0 6.7px 5.3px rgba(0,0,0,0.03),0 12.5px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0 22.3px 17.9px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0 41.8px 33.4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05),0 100px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);padding:14px 12px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n            <p style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:5px;line-height:1.3;color:#5a5a87;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 0 5px 0;\">SPECIAL REPORT</p>\n            <p style=\"font-family:Georgia,'Source Serif Pro',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 7px 0;\">Nutrition of Teenage Girls and Women in Humanitarian Crises</p>\n            <p style=\"font-family:Georgia,'Source Serif Pro',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:5.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 5px 0;\">Global humanitarian crises have reached unprecedented scale and complexity, with the world now facing the most severe food and nutrition crisis in modern history. In just three years since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic, the number of people in need of humanitarian assistance has surged from 168 million to an alarming 339 million.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-family:Georgia,'Source Serif Pro',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:5.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Humanitarian crises are growing more severe, disruptive, and prolonged than ever before. Many countries are confronting overlapping shocks — conflict and instability, extreme weather events, and disease outbreaks.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:4.5px;line-height:1.3;color:#29293e;margin:0;\">By Dr. Heather Esme-Collins MBBS, MRCPCH, MMed</p>\n            <!-- Simplified chart representation -->\n            <div style=\"margin-top:8px;width:100%;height:60px;background:linear-gradient(to right,#332c6c 0%,#332c6c 8%,transparent 8%,transparent 16%,#332c6c 16%,#332c6c 24%,transparent 24%,transparent 32%,#332c6c 32%,#332c6c 40%,transparent 40%,transparent 48%,#332c6c 48%,#332c6c 56%,transparent 56%,transparent 64%,#332c6c 64%,#332c6c 72%,transparent 72%,transparent 80%,#332c6c 80%,#332c6c 88%,transparent 88%,transparent 100%);background-size:100% 1px;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:bottom;position:relative;\">\n              <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:8%;height:45%;background:#332c6c;border-radius:1px 1px 0 0;opacity:0.8;\"></div>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:12%;width:8%;height:55%;background:#332c6c;border-radius:1px 1px 0 0;opacity:0.8;\"></div>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:24%;width:8%;height:35%;background:#332c6c;border-radius:1px 1px 0 0;opacity:0.8;\"></div>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:36%;width:8%;height:65%;background:#332c6c;border-radius:1px 1px 0 0;opacity:0.8;\"></div>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:48%;width:8%;height:80%;background:#332c6c;border-radius:1px 1px 0 0;opacity:0.8;\"></div>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:60%;width:8%;height:48%;background:#332c6c;border-radius:1px 1px 0 0;opacity:0.8;\"></div>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:72%;width:8%;height:70%;background:#332c6c;border-radius:1px 1px 0 0;opacity:0.8;\"></div>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:84%;width:8%;height:90%;background:#332c6c;border-radius:1px 1px 0 0;opacity:0.8;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col4img02.png\" alt=\"Document editing\" class=\"hz-img\" style=\"height:394px;background-color:#c0c0c0;\" />\n\n        <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107241.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810724\" class=\"hz-img\" style=\"height:393px;background-color:#cccccc;\" />\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
      "authorContentHtml": "<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-navBarContainer.png\" alt=\"Nav Bar Container\"></picture>\nPDF &amp; Productivity\n<h1>With great power comes great productivity.</h1>\n          <p>Do your best work faster with AI-powered document insights, secure collaboration, and professional content creation — all in one place.</p>\nTry Acrobat Studio\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-plus.png\" alt=\"Plus\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810732.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810732\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle2147231490.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n          <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-image3587.png\" alt=\"Signature artwork\"></picture>\n          Sign\n          Signature\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810731.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810731\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107321.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810732\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col2img02.png\" alt=\"Document collaboration\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810724.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810724\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810734.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810734\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col5img02.png\" alt=\"Productivity tools\"></picture>\n        <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810735.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810735\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-image.png\" alt=\"Document workspace\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107311.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810731\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810729.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810729\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810727.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<p>SPECIAL REPORT</p>\n            <p>Nutrition of Teenage Girls and Women in Humanitarian Crises</p>\n            <p>Global humanitarian crises have reached unprecedented scale and complexity, with the world now facing the most severe food and nutrition crisis in modern history. In just three years since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic, the number of people in need of humanitarian assistance has surged from 168 million to an alarming 339 million.</p>\n            <p>Humanitarian crises are growing more severe, disruptive, and prolonged than ever before. Many countries are confronting overlapping shocks — conflict and instability, extreme weather events, and disease outbreaks.</p>\n            <p>By Dr. Heather Esme-Collins MBBS, MRCPCH, MMed</p>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col4img02.png\" alt=\"Document editing\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107241.png\" alt=\"Rectangle 810724\"></picture>",
